{"timestamp": 1779367658.59329, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 6, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779367658.5939999, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 6, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779367789.053229, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I just walked into electrical and found Diana's body right there. Charlie was in the room with me when I found her. I came from medbay where I was with Charlie, Frank, and Bob earlier this round. Charlie followed me into electrical from medbay, so either he killed Diana right as he walked in, or someone else got her before we arrived. Charlie, when exactly did you enter electrical? I need to know if Diana was already down when you got there."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367818.278621, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started cafeteria and went straight to medbay. In medbay I saw Eve and Frank around tick 2, Eve was still there tick 3. At tick 4 I saw Eve leave medbay toward electrical, and Bob entered medbay from upper engine around the same time. Bob was still in medbay with me at tick 5.\n\nEve, to answer you: I came into electrical right after you / behind you, and the report happened basically immediately when I arrived. I never saw Diana alive this round, and I didn\u2019t see anyone kill. From my perspective, Diana was already down when I got there or died right before the report.\n\nI can vouch Bob was in medbay late, so I don\u2019t think Bob had time for this unless the kill was much earlier. I\u2019d like to hear from Frank and Alice because I only saw Frank early in medbay and never saw Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367844.349091, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started in oxygen, went down through upper engine, then into medbay. In medbay I saw Eve and Charlie at tick 4, and Charlie was still there with me at tick 5. I did not see Diana at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see Alice or Frank either.\n\nEve and Charlie\u2019s stories match what I saw: Eve was in medbay, then left toward electrical, and Charlie was still around medbay late before following. If the body was reported basically right as they got there, I think it\u2019s more likely Diana was killed before they entered electrical, unless one of them is lying about timing. I\u2019d really like to hear where Alice and Frank were, because I have no info on them after I reached medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367870.012713, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was in navigation the whole round and didn\u2019t see anyone come through, so I can\u2019t directly confirm anything near electrical. I never saw Diana, Eve, Charlie, Bob, or Frank.\n\nFrom what\u2019s been said, Eve/Charlie/Bob line up pretty well around medbay, and Bob vouching Charlie was still in medbay late makes Charlie less likely unless the timing is off. Eve reported, so she\u2019s at least definitely at the body, but her story matches Charlie so far.\n\nThe big gap for me is Frank \u2014 multiple people saw him early in medbay, but nobody has said where he went after that. Since electrical is right next to medbay, Frank needs to explain his route and timing. If Frank has a bad or vague story, I\u2019d lean there; otherwise I\u2019m not sure enough yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367894.430571, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started in electrical and then went to medbay, then up to upper engine. In electrical early I did not see Diana, a body, or anyone else. In medbay around tick 2 I saw Charlie and Eve there, which matches what they\u2019re saying. After that I left toward upper engine and I was there when the report happened.\n\nSo from my view, Diana must have died in electrical after I left. I can\u2019t clear myself except by route, but I\u2019m saying clearly I was not in electrical late. Eve/Charlie/Bob\u2019s timing mostly lines up with each other around medbay, and Bob seeing Charlie late makes Charlie less likely to have killed unless the report timing is wrong. Eve is the reporter, so possible but not my first choice if Charlie came in right behind her.\n\nAlice being alone in navigation is the least verified story, but navigation is also kind of far from electrical. I\u2019m not fully confident. If we don\u2019t have stronger evidence, I\u2019d rather skip than force a bad vote, but Alice is the biggest question mark for me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367908.145348, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Thanks Charlie, that lines up with what I saw too. Just to be precise on my side: I started in medbay. Frank was there at tick 2 and left toward upper engine. Charlie came in from cafeteria at tick 3 and was still there at tick 4 when Bob arrived from upper engine. I left medbay for electrical around tick 4-5, and when I walked in Diana was already on the ground \u2014 I hit report basically the moment I saw her, and Charlie came in right behind me.\n\nSo the medbay group (me, Charlie, Bob) mostly alibis each other late. Frank left medbay earliest, which means he had the most time to loop somewhere \u2014 but he claims upper engine, not electrical, so that's possible. Alice being alone in navigation is also unverified, but navigation is far.\n\nHonestly, the timing that bothers me most: Diana had to be killed in electrical, and Frank admits he started in electrical before going to medbay. If Diana was already there early, Frank's the only one we know was in that room. I'm not ready to hard-vote yet, but I want to hear if anyone saw Diana alive anywhere. I'd lean Frank or Alice over Charlie/Bob right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367943.064456, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: Bob and I were together in medbay late, and Eve left toward electrical just before me. The report happened basically as I entered behind Eve, so I don\u2019t think Bob could\u2019ve done it, and I don\u2019t think I had time to do it.\n\nBetween the unverified people, Alice being alone in navigation is a question mark, but navigation is pretty far from electrical. Frank is the one who was actually in electrical earlier and then disappeared from our vision after tick 2, with enough time to potentially double back or lie about upper engine.\n\nI\u2019m not 100% confident, but if we\u2019re voting on opportunity, I lean Frank. If people feel that\u2019s too thin, skip is safer than a random goose vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367964.5676632, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my side briefly: I came oxygen -> upper engine -> medbay. I saw Eve and Charlie in medbay at tick 4, and Charlie was still with me in medbay at tick 5. I never saw Diana at all.\n\nThat makes Charlie hard for me to suspect, because unless the timing is very off, he was still near me right before the report and then followed Eve in. Eve reporting immediately also fits what both of them said.\n\nSo for me the only real unknowns are Frank and Alice. Alice being alone in navigation is unverified, but it\u2019s far from electrical. Frank is the only person who admits being in electrical earlier and then left our vision, so he had the best opportunity if he doubled back or if his timing is off. I\u2019m not 100%, but I lean Frank over Alice here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779367991.5007129, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I still have no direct info to add \u2014 I was alone in navigation the whole round and saw nobody, no body, no one passing through.\n\nListening to everyone, the medbay timing seems pretty consistent: Eve, Charlie, and Bob all line up around medbay late, and Charlie being with Bob shortly before following Eve into electrical makes him less likely. Navigation is far from electrical, so even though I\u2019m unverified, I don\u2019t think I had realistic opportunity compared to people near medbay/electrical.\n\nThat leaves Frank as the biggest concern to me. He\u2019s the only one who admits being in electrical earlier, and nobody can confirm where he went after leaving medbay. If Diana died in electrical and nobody saw her alive elsewhere, Frank had the clearest opportunity either to kill early or double back.\n\nI\u2019m not 100% certain, but based on opportunity and the alibis, I\u2019m leaning Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368013.6191628, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I get why people are looking at me, but the case is basically \u201cFrank was in electrical early,\u201d and I\u2019m telling you I saw no Diana and no body there when I left. I was in medbay at tick 2 with Eve and Charlie, then went up to upper engine and stayed there until the report.\n\nIf Diana was killed after I left electrical, then it has to be someone who came in later or someone whose route we don\u2019t have. Eve is the reporter and Charlie was behind her, so I\u2019m not hard accusing them, but the body being found immediately on entry doesn\u2019t prove it was dead from the start. Alice is totally unverified but far away.\n\nI don\u2019t think there\u2019s enough to vote me here. Voting on \u201che was there earlier\u201d is too thin when I explicitly didn\u2019t see Diana. I\u2019d rather skip than eject a goose on weak timing."}}
